SUMMARY:Home Scent
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered how the scent of Eid fills our homes? And can we create this fragrance with our own hands? In this experience\, you will explore the secrets of making incense from a variety of natural ingredients and discover the different types of oud and their distinctive aromas. A sensory journey infused with the spirit of Eid\, bringing back the warmth of homes and the gathering of loved ones.
